# Data/Talk/names/coldwater.names (Docs/Design/84-living-conversations.md §7.10, Phase 10): Coldwater's: the lake's names, soft and wet as Glasswater.
# Drafts, to settle with the user by ear. A child born here takes one (its mother's surname after it): no two living
# residents share a full name, no living parent or sibling shares the child's first name, and one born in place of a
# dead grandparent takes their first name named_for of the time. Male or female only.
